  "historyNote": "#4985, eff 11-19-90; ss by #6355-A, eff 11-20-96; ss by #8193, INTERIM, eff 11-12-04, EXPIRES: 5-11-05; ss by #8310, eff 5-11-05; amd by #9501, eff 7-6-09; ss by #10364, eff 7-1-13; amd by #10827, eff 5-16-15; ss by #13708, eff 7-29-23 (see Revision Note at chapter heading for Adm 600)",
